# Dockerfile-specific ignore for the finder-builder build.
# BuildKit uses `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` (this file) INSTEAD of the repo-root .dockerignore,
# which excludes `subrepos/`. This build needs subrepos/finder + subrepos/python-utils in context,
# so we do NOT exclude them here — just trim heavy/irrelevant junk.
.git
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
